Package: plvr
Title: Download Taiwan MOI Real Estate Transaction Open Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Liou", "Yuyou", email = "yuyou.liou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Download Taiwan Ministry of the Interior (MOI) real-estate
    actual-price registration open data (sale, presale, rent) for a given
    date range. The source publishes data per calendar quarter
    (https://plvr.land.moi.gov.tw/DownloadOpenData); this package maps a
    yyyy-mm-dd range to the quarters it overlaps, downloads each quarter's
    zip, extracts only the requested datasets/counties, writes one Parquet
    file per quarter per dataset, and deletes the raw zips to keep disk use
    low.
